@@ -0,0 +1,110 @@
+/* Interpreter Hub: the bilingual card and the small message bridge to the Hub.
+
+   The viewer runs in a sandboxed frame with no access to the Hub. It never
+   gets the glossary, a name, a sign-in or anything a teammate wrote. All it
+   can do is tell the Hub which catalogued structure is on screen and which
+   card button was tapped. The Hub checks every message and does the work
+   itself, using its own copy of the catalogue (never text from here).
+
+   Messages to the Hub ({source:'hub-atlas', v:1, ...}):
+     ready                                   the viewer is listening
+     card    id                              the card now shows this structure (or null)
+     action  id, action, lang?, view         a card button: glossary, practice, ask, pronounce
